{"id":"cs-cdb6b3","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-6deb86b5-4ab3-4602-9ce9-77a21f4327c1","text":"Implemented the root Makefile with `help` (default), `build`, and `test` targets.\n\nVerification:\n- `make` prints concise target help.\n- `make test` passes all 164 ColorsipCore tests.\n- `make build` completes the Release app build successfully.\n- Stubbed failing `XCODEBUILD` and `SWIFT` commands confirm failures propagate through make.\n- `git diff --check` passes.\n\nSmall implementation decision: the command names and build configuration are overridable Make variables (`XCODEBUILD`, `SWIFT`, and `CONFIGURATION`) while retaining the repository's documented defaults."},"created_at":"2026-10-14T11:36:52.921467Z","created_by":"codex-mcp-client/0.162.1 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
