{"id":"cs-7940c0","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-0a6a2944-fd11-4323-b0f7-e63e62d85907","text":"Fix after review: `make build` with the cert failed because a command-line `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY` applies to every target, including the ColorsipCore SPM resource bundle (\"requires a development team\"). The Makefile and local xcconfig now set a custom `COLORSIP_SIGNING_IDENTITY`, which only the app target's `Config/Signing.xcconfig` maps to `CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY`. Spec updated. Verified: two signed rebuilds give the same DR `identifier \"com.nicolas-bettenburg.colorsip\" and certificate leaf = H\"a6ae6426…\"`."},"created_at":"2026-10-14T15:28:25.37528Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.299 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
