{"id":"cs-995046","type":"ARTIFACT","payload":{"artifact_type":"spec","filename":"spec.md","action":"updated"},"created_at":"2026-10-15T08:04:01.973447Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.300 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"cs-995046","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-3ab3a483-224f-4dc8-99b3-01a5cf54d55a","text":"Implementation ready for review (not committed).\n\n**Core (`ColorsipCore`, tested)**\n- `PickerSession`: `mode` (`PickerMode` single/multi, starts single every session), and `click(at:shift:)`, `confirm()`, `cancel()` return a `PickerStep` (`.pick(color, close:)`, `.close`, `.none`). These replace `finish(_:)`. The session tracks whether the loupe moved since the last pick, for multi-mode Return/Space.\n- `PickerModeMenu`: menu layout and hit test. `optionChanged(isDown:)` opens or closes it.\n- `LibraryController.addPick`: inserts at the front of the target's ungrouped section as one \"Pick Color\" undo step. Skipped with no target, a locked target, or a duplicate.\n- `routePick`: history → target palette → clipboard, run at every pick.\n- 382 tests pass (`make test`). `make build` succeeds.\n\n**App:** `PickerController` acts on `PickerStep`s and handles Option (`.flagsChanged`). `LoupeView` draws the menu. `AppModel.didPick` routes the pick.\n\n**Decisions not in the original description** (now in the spec)\n- While Option is held, the loupe freezes and the system cursor shows, so the menu can be clicked. Otherwise the loupe would carry the menu along. Releasing Option warps the pointer back to the loupe. Clicks outside the items, arrows and Return do nothing while the menu is open.\n- Hyper+P includes Option: an Option still held from the shortcut is ignored until it's released.\n- No visual feedback per pick in multi mode yet (only the clipboard, history and palette change).\n\n**Manual testing needed:** the overlay event handling, the cursor show/hide and warp, and the menu drawing can't be automated. Not yet verified by hand."},"created_at":"2026-10-15T08:08:40.492131Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.300 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
{"id":"cs-995046","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-cd0f87a0-5de0-4b59-baeb-5a6891d48d7e","text":"Revision: a multi indicator on the loupe (spec updated).\n- The loupe label gets a third line, **MULTI** in the accent color, whenever the next click keeps the picker open: in multi mode, or while Shift is held.\n- Core: `PickerSession.shiftChanged(isDown:)` and `PickerLabel.isMulti`, with a test. The controller passes Shift from `.flagsChanged`, plus its state when the picker opens.\n- The label drawing now takes a list of lines.\n- 383 tests pass and the app builds. Not yet checked by hand."},"created_at":"2026-10-15T08:23:50.953369Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.300 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
