{"id":"cs-722793","type":"COMMENT","payload":{"id":"cmt-78afca29-c6b4-4828-9d0c-376481ff79e8","text":"Added a checkerboard behind translucent swatches (alpha \u003c 1) in the popover's strips, for both palettes and Color History. The editor's `Checkerboard` is now shared with `SwatchStrip`. I updated the spec first (new section, an acceptance criterion and decision 6). The Debug build succeeds. This is view-only and has no Core logic, so I haven't checked it in the running app."},"created_at":"2026-10-15T12:38:19.743474Z","created_by":"claude-code/2.1.300 \u003cagent@mcp\u003e","on_behalf_of":"Nicolas Bettenburg \u003cnicbet@gmail.com\u003e","source":"mcp"}
